# R52: an external application consuming a data product that is not externally shared.
@prefix adp: <https://example.org/acme/data-platform#> .

adp:crmCustomers a adp:DataProduct .
adp:externalBilling a adp:ExternalApplication .
adp:billingApp a adp:ServicePrincipal ; adp:identityOf adp:externalBilling ; adp:serviceConsumes adp:crmCustomers .
